---
title: Desktop setup, first draft
description: "Draft first screen of the desktop app before it has a server: a replica of the artifact frame's chrome (icon and title, no menu or navigation) over the Clouds wallpaper, blurred. The frame rules are copied from specs/ui/app/artifact-frame/artifact-frame.frame, minus the fill-height and document-iframe rules this replica has no use for."
data:
  prompt: "Set up Television for me by following https://television.run/install.md"
style: |
  /* The window: the default (Clouds) wallpaper, blurred, with the setup frame
     centred on it. */
  .desktop-setup {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    min-height: 100vh;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    padding: var(--space-32);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Oversized past the window so the blur doesn't fade at the edges. */
  .setup-wallpaper {
    position: absolute;
    inset: calc(-1 * var(--space-48));
    z-index: -1;
    background: var(--app-wallpaper);
    filter: blur(24px);
  }

  .setup-frame {
    width: min(560px, 100%);
  }

  /* Replica of the artifact frame's chrome: the rules are copied from
     specs/ui/app/artifact-frame/artifact-frame.frame under replica- class
     names, since the second draft renders real artifact frames in the same
     document. */
  .replica-frame {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: 0;
    background: var(--frame-background);
    background-clip: border-box;
    box-shadow: var(--artifact-frame-shadow);
    border: var(--frame-border);
    border-radius: var(--frame-radius);
  }

  .replica-frame-clip {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 0;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: inherit;
  }

  .replica-frame::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: inherit;
    box-shadow: var(--panel-edge-shadow);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .replica-frame::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: inherit;
    padding: 1px;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: calc(var(--layer-ground) + 2);
    background: var(--panel-edge-highlight);
    font-size: var(--frame-radius);
    mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);
    mask-composite: exclude;
  }

  .replica-title-bar {
    position: relative;
    flex: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    padding: var(--frame-titlebar-padding);
    background: var(--frame-titlebar-background);
    color: var(--frame-titlebar-text-color);
    border-top: var(--frame-titlebar-border);
    margin: 0 -1px -1px;
    border-left: 1px solid transparent;
    border-right: 1px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    background-clip: border-box;
  }

  .replica-title-bar .replica-title {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }

  /* The setup document inside the frame. */
  .setup-document {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-24);
    padding: var(--space-32);
  }

  .setup-document h1,
  .setup-document h2,
  .setup-document p,
  .setup-steps {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .setup-intro {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }

  .setup-document h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
  }

  .setup-intro p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .setup-steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-24);
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .setup-step {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }

  .setup-document h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
  }

  .setup-prompt {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-12);
    padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-8) var(--space-8) var(--space-12);
    background: var(--color-surface-muted);
    border-radius: var(--control-radius);
  }

  .setup-prompt p {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .setup-connect {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }

  .setup-connect input {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }
---
<div class="desktop-setup" data-staging-theme="clouds">
  <div class="setup-wallpaper" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="replica-frame setup-frame">
    <div class="replica-frame-clip">
      <div class="setup-document">
        <div class="setup-intro">
          <h1>Welcome to Television</h1>
          <p>Television runs alongside your AI agent. Ask your agent to set it up, then paste the link it gives you.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="setup-steps">
          <li class="setup-step">
            <h2>1. Give your agent this prompt</h2>
            <div class="setup-prompt">
              <p>{{ prompt }}</p>
              {% render '../../../specs/ui/app/copy-button/copy-button', label: 'Copy prompt', prompt: prompt %}
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="setup-step">
            <h2>2. Paste the link from your agent</h2>
            <form class="setup-connect">
              <input type="text" placeholder="http://…" aria-label="Link from your agent" required>
              <button intent="primary">Connect</button>
            </form>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <footer class="replica-title-bar">
        {% render '../../../specs/ui/foundation/icons/icon', name: 'artifact' %}
        <span class="replica-title">Set up Television</span>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
